{
  "clause": "ui-interfaces §5",
  "check": "offer.replay_policy",
  "about": "What a driver's end makes of an offer's replay policy. A policy that lowers a floor of graded-introspection §9 is refused as unreadable, naming the entry: vary performing a non_idempotent effect (the fourth floor), or compensated in either column (the fifth, compensation is offered and never automatic). So is a sandboxed disposition that names no declared sandbox serving what the entry covers, and an entry for an action the offer does not list. The answer is {reads: true} or {refused}.",
